user@ubuntu-4gb-nbg1-3:~/workspace$ (machine with 16 vcpus, 1 thread/vcpu)
[B/B/B/B/./././././././././././.] shows threads accessible by the mpi process, however main thread of the process is bound to a single constant core 
OpenMP will take over inside the MPI, then detect 4 threads and parallize inside parallel regions

OMP_DISPLAY_ENV=true OMP_DISPLAY_AFFINITY=true OMP_PLACES=cores OMP_PROC_BIND=true mpirun --report-bindings --map-by slot:PE=4 --bind-to core -np 4 prog

